    <h3>Simulate Customer</h3>
    <p>Click these buttons to trigger common customer messages. Practice guiding them through your booking flow on the left.</p>

    <button class="control-btn customer-trigger" data-message="How much do you charge?">💰 Ask for Pricing</button>
    <button class="control-btn customer-trigger" data-message="What does that package include exactly?">📦 Ask for Details</button>
